# GHDL build artifacts. The runners (run_gate2.sh / run_corners.sh) write
# elaboration output to an out-of-repo $WORK via `ghdl … -o "$WORK/<unit>"`, so
# nothing should land here; these rules are the belt-and-suspenders net, and
# build/ is the directory-containment convention for any in-tree build dir.
build/
*.o
*.cf
e~*
work-obj*.cf
# Elaborated sim executables (extensionless). Listed by EXACT name: a `tb_*` glob
# would also swallow the tb_*.vhd SOURCE that lives in this same directory.
tb_sequency_corners
tb_sequency_fader
tb_sequency_inert
tb_sequency_null
tb_sequency_probe
tb_sequency_state
tb_sequency_identity_adv
tb_sequency_vblank
*.ghw
*.vcd
